<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar ends up slightly on intervention.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar ends up slightly on intervention.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed marginally firmer at 470.50/471.50 in a quiet market that was well supplied by Central Bank dollars, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;The Central Bank intervened whenever needed, covering (dollar) demand,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>The unit closed Monday at 471.00/472.00 bolivars.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
